# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-01 21:08

translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:41
    old "You pull the covers back and reach for the lamp. Before you can turn it off, someone knocks. Three soft knocks, then one hard one."
    new "Retiras las sábanas y alcanzas la lámpara. Antes de apagarla, alguien toca la puerta. Tres golpes suaves, y luego uno fuerte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:41
    old "A knock at your door. You already know that knock."
    new "Tocan a tu puerta. Ya conoces esa forma de tocar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Sunday dinner. Your father talks about work, the stock market, the neighbor's dog. She barely touches her plate."
    new "Cena de domingo. Tu padre habla del trabajo, de la bolsa, del perro del vecino. Ella apenas toca su plato."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Right, honey? Tell him about the gala."
    new "¿Verdad, cariño? Cuéntale de la gala."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Your father exaggerates. It was a party with expensive napkins."
    new "Tu padre exagera. Fue una fiesta con servilletas caras."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Her eyes find yours across the table, and stay there a second too long."
    new "Sus ojos encuentran los tuyos al otro lado de la mesa, y se quedan ahí un segundo de más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Something has changed between you two. She laughs at your jokes now. She asks about your week, and listens to the answer."
    new "Algo cambió entre ustedes dos. Ahora se ríe de tus chistes. Te pregunta por tu semana, y escucha la respuesta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Under the table, a hand settles on your knee. Warm. Light. Waiting to see if you pull away."
    new "Por debajo de la mesa, una mano se posa en tu rodilla. Cálida. Ligera. Esperando a ver si te apartas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "You don't. You lay your hand over hers."
    new "No te apartas. Pones tu mano sobre la suya."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Your father is right, you know. You've grown up."
    new "Tu padre tiene razón, ¿sabes? Ya creciste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Her thumb draws slow circles on your knee while your father talks about mortgage rates."
    new "Su pulgar dibuja círculos lentos en tu rodilla mientras tu padre habla de tasas hipotecarias."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "She's drinking faster than usual tonight. When your father turns to open another bottle, her foot slides up your calf."
    new "Esta noche está bebiendo más rápido de lo normal. Cuando tu padre se gira para abrir otra botella, su pie sube por tu pantorrilla."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Higher. Then her hand, on your thigh, under the tablecloth."
    new "Más arriba. Luego su mano, en tu muslo, debajo del mantel."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Everything okay, son? You look a little flushed."
    new "¿Todo bien, hijo? Te ves un poco colorado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "It's the wine. Pour him another glass, darling. He's a grown man now."
    new "Es el vino. Sírvele otra copa, cariño. Ya es todo un hombre."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Her hand doesn't move. Not while your father pours. Not while he sits back down."
    new "Su mano no se mueve. Ni mientras tu padre sirve. Ni cuando vuelve a sentarse."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "She has been following your lead lately. Small things. Who pours, who speaks first, who looks away."
    new "Últimamente ha estado siguiendo tu ejemplo. Cosas pequeñas. Quién sirve, quién habla primero, quién aparta la mirada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Tonight you don't look away. Under the table, you take her wrist and lay her hand on your thigh."
    new "Esta noche no apartas la mirada. Por debajo de la mesa, le tomas la muñeca y pones su mano sobre tu muslo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "She could pull it back. She doesn't."
    new "Podría retirarla. No lo hace."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "...Eat your dinner, [Player.Name]."
    new "...Come tu cena, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Her hand stays exactly where you put it."
    new "Su mano se queda exactamente donde la pusiste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "I'll get dessert. Don't fight while I'm gone, you two."
    new "Voy por el postre. No se peleen mientras no estoy, ustedes dos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:120
    old "Her hand stays on your thigh a moment longer. Then it's gone."
    new "Su mano se queda en tu muslo un momento más. Luego se va."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Sunday dinner at the apartment. Your father carves, talks, and refills every glass but hers. She refills her own."
    new "Cena de domingo en el departamento. Tu padre trincha, habla, y llena todas las copas menos la de ella. Ella llena la suya."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Sunday dinner. The good plates, the expensive wine, and your father's voice filling every silence."
    new "Cena de domingo. Los platos buenos, el vino caro, y la voz de tu padre llenando cada silencio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Dinner with your father and his wife. The candles are lit. Nobody remembers why."
    new "Cena con tu padre y su esposa. Las velas están encendidas. Nadie recuerda por qué."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "So, how's school, son? Keeping those grades up?"
    new "Y bien, ¿cómo va la universidad, hijo? ¿Manteniendo esas notas?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She sets her fork down and waits for your answer like it's a quarterly report."
    new "Deja el tenedor y espera tu respuesta como si fuera un informe trimestral."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Say she's the reason you study harder."
    new "Decir que ella es la razón por la que estudias más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Honestly? She's the reason I study harder now."
    new "¿Sinceramente? Ella es la razón por la que ahora estudio más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Flattery. It's working, a little."
    new "...Halagos. Está funcionando, un poco."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Don't thank me. Just don't fail."
    new "No me agradezcas. Solo no repruebes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Say she'll see your grades when you're ready."
    new "Decir que verá tus notas cuando estés listo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "You'll see my grades when I'm ready to show them."
    new "Verás mis notas cuando yo esté listo para mostrarlas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Fine. When you're ready. Don't make me wait too long."
    new "...Está bien. Cuando estés listo. No me hagas esperar demasiado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "You'll show me when I ask. Not a day later."
    new "Me las vas a mostrar cuando yo lo pida. Ni un día después."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Nudge her foot under the table."
    new "Rozar su pie por debajo de la mesa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She doesn't move her foot away. She doesn't look at you either."
    new "No aparta el pie. Tampoco te mira."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Your father asked you a question, [Player.Name]."
    new "Tu padre te hizo una pregunta, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She moves her foot and gives you a look that could freeze the wine."
    new "Aparta el pie y te lanza una mirada capaz de congelar el vino."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Your father tells the same story about his boss for the third time. She refills her glass and stares at the bottom of it."
    new "Tu padre cuenta la misma historia sobre su jefe por tercera vez. Ella llena su copa y se queda mirando el fondo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Ask her about her week."
    new "Preguntarle por su semana."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "How was your week? You never say."
    new "¿Cómo estuvo tu semana? Nunca lo dices."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Nobody asks me that."
    new "Nadie me pregunta eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Long. It was long. Thank you for asking."
    new "...Larga. Fue larga. Gracias por preguntar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "My week is none of your concern."
    new "Mi semana no es asunto tuyo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Take the bottle and pour for her."
    new "Tomar la botella y servirle."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Sit back. I'll pour."
    new "Recuéstate. Yo sirvo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Go on, then. Not too much."
    new "...Adelante, entonces. No demasiado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Nobody pours my wine in my own house."
    new "Nadie me sirve el vino en mi propia casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Hold her eyes over your glass a little too long."
    new "Sostenerle la mirada por encima de la copa un poco de más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She holds your look until your father turns back to the table."
    new "Te sostiene la mirada hasta que tu padre vuelve a girarse hacia la mesa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Eyes on your plate, [Player.Name]."
    new "Los ojos en el plato, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Help %s with the plates, will you, son? The game's about to start."
    new "¿Ayudas a %s con los platos, hijo? El partido está por empezar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "The kitchen is small. She hands you a plate without looking at you."
    new "La cocina es pequeña. Te pasa un plato sin mirarte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Tell her this was the best part of your week."
    new "Decirle que esto fue lo mejor de tu semana."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "This was the best part of my week."
    new "Esto fue lo mejor de mi semana."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Go, before I say something nice back."
    new "...Vete, antes de que te diga algo amable también."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "It was just dinner. Don't be dramatic."
    new "Fue solo una cena. No seas dramático."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Tell her to leave the dishes to you."
    new "Decirle que deje los platos en tus manos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Leave them. I've got this."
    new "Déjalos. Yo me encargo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Fine. Don't break anything."
    new "...Está bien. No rompas nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "In my kitchen, I give the orders."
    new "En mi cocina, las órdenes las doy yo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Stand right behind her at the sink."
    new "Pararte justo detrás de ella en el fregadero."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She doesn't step away. For a moment you can feel her breathing."
    new "No se aparta. Por un momento sientes su respiración."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Your father is twenty feet away."
    new "...Tu padre está a seis metros."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She elbows you back a step without even turning around."
    new "Te hace retroceder un paso de un codazo, sin siquiera darse la vuelta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "A toast! To family. To the two people I love most in the world."
    new "¡Un brindis! Por la familia. Por las dos personas que más quiero en el mundo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She raises her glass and looks straight at you while she drinks."
    new "Levanta la copa y te mira directo mientras bebe."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Raise your glass to her."
    new "Levantar la copa hacia ella."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "To family."
    new "Por la familia."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...To family."
    new "...Por la familia."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Refill her glass before your father can."
    new "Llenarle la copa antes de que lo haga tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Thank you, [Player.Name]. Your father could learn a thing or two."
    new "Gracias, [Player.Name]. Tu padre podría aprender una o dos cosas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "...Thank you."
    new "...Gracias."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Slide your foot up her leg during the toast."
    new "Deslizar el pie por su pierna durante el brindis."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She doesn't even blink. She just drinks, slowly, and lets you."
    new "Ni siquiera pestañea. Solo bebe, despacio, y te deja."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She kicks your ankle under the table."
    new "Te patea el tobillo por debajo de la mesa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Same time next week, son!"
    new "¡A la misma hora la semana que viene, hijo!"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Next week. And every week after that."
    new "La semana que viene. Y todas las semanas después."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Same time next week, son. Right, honey?"
    new "A la misma hora la semana que viene, hijo. ¿Verdad, cariño?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "If he can find the time."
    new "Si encuentra el tiempo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "She sets her glass down and looks at you, longer than she needs to."
    new "Deja su copa y te mira, más tiempo del necesario."

    old "You're getting better at these. The dinners, I mean."
    new "Estás mejorando en esto. Las cenas, digo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:165
    old "Next Sunday. Don't make me wait."
    new "El próximo domingo. No me hagas esperar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "She opens the door in a silk robe and doesn't say a word. She just takes your hand and leads you down the hall."
    new "Abre la puerta en una bata de seda y no dice una palabra. Solo te toma de la mano y te lleva por el pasillo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "Their bedroom. His side of the bed is still unmade. On the nightstand, a framed photo from their wedding."
    new "Su dormitorio. El lado de él de la cama sigue sin hacer. En la mesita de noche, una foto enmarcada de su boda."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "I'm tired of stolen hours in your dorm. I want you here. In my life. In my bed."
    new "Estoy cansada de horas robadas en tu dormitorio. Te quiero aquí. En mi vida. En mi cama."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "She turns the wedding photo face down without looking at it."
    new "Pone boca abajo la foto de la boda sin mirarla."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "Just once, I want to wake up next to someone who actually sees me."
    new "Solo una vez, quiero despertar junto a alguien que de verdad me vea."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "She picks up the wedding photo, looks at it for a long second, and sets it back down facing the bed."
    new "Toma la foto de la boda, la mira un largo segundo, y la vuelve a poner mirando hacia la cama."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "Let him watch. Nothing worth watching has happened in this bed in a long time."
    new "Que mire. Hace mucho tiempo que no pasa nada en esta cama que valga la pena mirar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "I've wanted to do this since the day I moved in."
    new "Quería hacer esto desde el día en que me mudé aquí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "I kept telling myself: anywhere but here. Not in his bed."
    new "Me repetía a mí misma: en cualquier lugar menos aquí. No en su cama."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "...Then tell me where."
    new "...Entonces dime dónde."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:269
    old "You point at the bed. She slips off her robe and lies down on his side."
    new "Señalas la cama. Ella se quita la bata y se acuesta en el lado de él."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "Your father left for his trip at six."
    new "Tu padre salió de viaje a las seis."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "The apartment is empty."
    new "El departamento está vacío."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "Come home. Now."
    new "Ven a casa. Ahora."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "He's back in a few days. Be free the next time he leaves."
    new "Vuelve en unos días. Más te vale estar libre la próxima vez que se vaya."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "No condom? ...Then lie back. I'll use my mouth."
    new "¿Sin condón? ...Entonces recuéstate. Usaré la boca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "Afterwards, she lies on his pillow and laughs, quietly, at nothing."
    new "Después, se acuesta en la almohada de él y se ríe, en voz baja, de nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:301
    old "I'm changing these sheets before he gets home. ...Maybe."
    new "Voy a cambiar estas sábanas antes de que él llegue. ...Quizás."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Your father is home, glued to the game in the living room. She finds you in the kitchen and stands a little too close."
    new "Tu padre está en casa, pegado al partido en la sala. Ella te encuentra en la cocina y se pone demasiado cerca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "He'll be in front of that TV for two hours. Maybe three."
    new "Va a estar frente a esa tele dos horas. Quizás tres."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Kiss her, quick and quiet."
    new "Besarla, rápido y en silencio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "She kisses you back, one hand on your chest, listening for the couch."
    new "Te devuelve el beso, una mano en tu pecho, atenta al sofá."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "...Go back out there before he wonders."
    new "...Vuelve allá antes de que se pregunte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Not with him in the next room. Are you insane?"
    new "No con él en el cuarto de al lado. ¿Estás loco?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Tell her to send him out for something."
    new "Decirle que mande a tu padre a buscar algo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Send him to the store. Now."
    new "Mándalo al supermercado. Ahora."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "She walks into the living room. A minute later, the front door closes behind your father."
    new "Va a la sala. Un minuto después, la puerta de entrada se cierra detrás de tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Twenty minutes. Don't waste them."
    new "Veinte minutos. No los desperdicies."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "You don't. When his car pulls back in, she's fixing her hair in the hallway mirror."
    new "No los desperdicias. Cuando su auto vuelve a entrar, ella se está arreglando el pelo en el espejo del pasillo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "You don't give orders in this house."
    new "Tú no das órdenes en esta casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Pull her into the pantry."
    new "Meterla en la despensa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "She lets you. In the dark, her breathing is the loudest thing in the apartment."
    new "Ella se deja. En la oscuridad, su respiración es lo más ruidoso del departamento."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "%s? Have you seen the remote?"
    new "¿%s? ¿Has visto el control remoto?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "Under the cushion, darling!"
    new "¡Debajo del cojín, cariño!"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "She doesn't move until his footsteps fade."
    new "No se mueve hasta que sus pasos se alejan."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:330
    old "She slips out of your grip and goes back to the living room without a word."
    new "Se escurre de tus manos y vuelve a la sala sin decir nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Ten minutes. I just need ten minutes away from that apartment."
    new "Diez minutos. Solo necesito diez minutos lejos de ese departamento."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "She drops onto your bed and stares at your ceiling."
    new "Se deja caer en tu cama y se queda mirando el techo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Lie down next to her and listen."
    new "Acostarte a su lado y escuchar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "She talks about nothing for a while. Then she goes quiet, her head on your shoulder."
    new "Habla de nada por un rato. Luego se queda callada, con la cabeza en tu hombro."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "...This is the only quiet place I have left."
    new "...Este es el único lugar tranquilo que me queda."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Don't. I didn't come here to be comforted."
    new "No. No vine aquí para que me consuelen."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Tell her to tell you what happened."
    new "Pedirle que te cuente qué pasó."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Tell me what he did."
    new "Cuéntame qué hizo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "He forgot. Again. Something small. It's always something small."
    new "Se olvidó. Otra vez. Algo pequeño. Siempre es algo pequeño."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "...Thank you for asking like you actually want to know."
    new "...Gracias por preguntar como si de verdad quisieras saberlo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "I don't need to be interviewed."
    new "No necesito que me interroguen."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Lock the door."
    new "Cerrar la puerta con llave."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "She hears the lock click and doesn't get up."
    new "Oye el clic de la cerradura y no se levanta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Ten minutes, I said. ...Make it twenty."
    new "Diez minutos, dije. ...Que sean veinte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "Unlock it. I'm not staying."
    new "Ábrela. No me voy a quedar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:356
    old "She leaves before the hallway fills up with students."
    new "Se va antes de que el pasillo se llene de estudiantes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Her phone lights up on the nightstand. Your father's name is on the screen."
    new "Su teléfono se ilumina en la mesita de noche. El nombre de tu padre está en la pantalla."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "...It's him."
    new "...Es él."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Stop and let her take it."
    new "Detenerte y dejar que conteste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "She answers, says three calm sentences about a late meeting, and hangs up."
    new "Contesta, dice tres frases tranquilas sobre una reunión que se alargó, y cuelga."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "...Thank you for stopping."
    new "...Gracias por detenerte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "She lets it ring out, rattled."
    new "Lo deja sonar hasta que se corta, alterada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Just... give me a second."
    new "Solo... dame un segundo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Tell her to ignore it."
    new "Decirle que lo ignore."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Ignore it."
    new "Ignóralo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "She turns the phone face down without a word."
    new "Pone el teléfono boca abajo sin decir nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "...He can wait."
    new "...Él puede esperar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Don't tell me what to do with my husband's calls."
    new "No me digas qué hacer con las llamadas de mi marido."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Keep going while it rings."
    new "Seguir mientras suena."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "It rings. And rings. She bites her lip and doesn't make a sound until it stops."
    new "Suena. Y suena. Se muerde el labio y no hace ningún ruido hasta que se detiene."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:381
    old "Stop! ...Stop. Just until it stops ringing."
    new "¡Detente! ...Detente. Solo hasta que deje de sonar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "When you open the door, she's standing in the hallway. Her makeup is ruined, and she's wearing her coat over her pajamas."
    new "Cuando abres la puerta, está en el pasillo. Tiene el maquillaje corrido, y lleva el abrigo encima del pijama."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "I had a fight with your father. I couldn't stay in that apartment one more minute."
    new "Me peleé con tu padre. No aguantaba quedarme en ese departamento ni un minuto más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "She walks past you and sits on the edge of your bed like it's the only place left in the city."
    new "Pasa a tu lado y se sienta en el borde de tu cama como si fuera el último lugar que queda en la ciudad."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "He talks over me. He always has. You're the only one in that family who listens."
    new "Habla por encima de mí. Siempre lo ha hecho. Eres el único en esa familia que escucha."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "She talks for an hour. About him, about work, about living with a man who never really looks at her."
    new "Habla durante una hora. De él, del trabajo, de vivir con un hombre que nunca la mira de verdad."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "...Why am I telling you this? You, of all people."
    new "...¿Por qué te estoy contando esto? A ti, precisamente."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "When she finally looks up at you, she doesn't look away."
    new "Cuando por fin levanta la mirada hacia ti, no la aparta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "Come here. Don't say anything. Just come here."
    new "Ven aquí. No digas nada. Solo ven aquí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "She smells of wine. A lot of wine. Outside, a cab is pulling away."
    new "Huele a vino. Mucho vino. Afuera, un taxi se está yendo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "Don't look at me like that. I had two glasses. Maybe four."
    new "No me mires así. Tomé dos copas. Quizás cuatro."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "Do you know what I thought on the way here? That this is the worst idea I've ever had."
    new "¿Sabes qué pensé en el camino? Que esta es la peor idea que he tenido."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "She laughs, and reaches for your belt."
    new "Se ríe, y busca tu cinturón."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "And I don't care."
    new "Y no me importa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "She doesn't explain why she came here instead of anywhere else. She just waits, like she's waiting for you to tell her what happens now."
    new "No explica por qué vino aquí y no a cualquier otro lugar. Solo espera, como si esperara que tú le dijeras qué pasa ahora."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "Tell me what to do. I'm so tired of being the one who decides."
    new "Dime qué hacer. Estoy tan cansada de ser la que decide."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "You close the door behind her and tell her to take off her coat. She does."
    new "Cierras la puerta detrás de ella y le dices que se quite el abrigo. Lo hace."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "...Like that?"
    new "...¿Así?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "But that's not why she's here. She came for something else."
    new "Pero no es por eso que está aquí. Vino por otra cosa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:417
    old "Those videos of me. Your father can never see them. Not now. Not after tonight."
    new "Esos videos míos. Tu padre nunca puede verlos. No ahora. No después de esta noche."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:463
    old "Afterwards, she sits on the edge of the bed for a long time, staring at the wall."
    new "Después, se queda sentada al borde de la cama un buen rato, mirando la pared."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:463
    old "Your father wakes up at six. I have to be in that bed when he does."
    new "Tu padre se despierta a las seis. Tengo que estar en esa cama cuando lo haga."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:463
    old "She fixes her coat in the dark. At the door, she stops without turning around."
    new "Se arregla el abrigo a oscuras. En la puerta, se detiene sin darse la vuelta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:463
    old "...You're right. This was a mistake. Forget I was here."
    new "...Tienes razón. Esto fue un error. Olvida que estuve aquí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:463
    old "She buttons her coat and leaves without another word."
    new "Se abotona el abrigo y se va sin decir una palabra más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Can't sleep."
    new "No puedo dormir."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Are you awake?"
    new "¿Estás despierto?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "I'm awake. Want to talk?"
    new "Estoy despierto. ¿Quieres hablar?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "...Yes. Just for a minute."
    new "...Sí. Solo un minuto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Tell me something about your day. Anything."
    new "Cuéntame algo de tu día. Lo que sea."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Never mind. Go to sleep."
    new "Olvídalo. Ve a dormir."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Go to sleep. Text me tomorrow."
    new "Ve a dormir. Escríbeme mañana."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "...Fine. Goodnight, then."
    new "...Está bien. Buenas noches, entonces."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "You're bossy tonight. I don't hate it."
    new "Estás mandón esta noche. No lo odio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Don't tell me what to do."
    new "No me digas qué hacer."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Come over."
    new "Ven para acá."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Absolutely not. Goodnight."
    new "Ni loca. Buenas noches."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Gala next week. Black or red?"
    new "Gala la semana que viene. ¿Negro o rojo?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Red. You'd look incredible."
    new "Rojo. Te verías increíble."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Red it is. ...Thank you."
    new "Rojo, entonces. ...Gracias."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Hmm. Black, then."
    new "Hmm. Negro, entonces."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Black. Wear the black one."
    new "Negro. Ponte el negro."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "...Black. Fine. Because you said so."
    new "...Negro. Está bien. Porque tú lo dijiste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "I didn't ask for orders."
    new "No pedí órdenes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Whichever comes off easier."
    new "El que se quite más fácil."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "You're terrible. ...The red one."
    new "Eres terrible. ...El rojo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Watch your mouth."
    new "Cuidado con lo que dices."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "I keep thinking about the other night."
    new "No dejo de pensar en la otra noche."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Me too. I can't stop."
    new "Yo tampoco. No puedo dejar de hacerlo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Good. ...I mean it. Good."
    new "Bien. ...Lo digo en serio. Bien."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Forget I said that."
    new "Olvida que dije eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Then come back. Soon."
    new "Entonces vuelve. Pronto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "...Maybe I will."
    new "...Quizás lo haga."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "You don't get to summon me."
    new "No tienes derecho a llamarme cuando se te antoja."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Tell me what you're thinking about."
    new "Dime en qué estás pensando."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:491
    old "Not over text. Are you insane?"
    new "No por mensaje. ¿Estás loco?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:625
    old "Let it happen"
    new "Dejar que pase"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:627
    old "Send her home"
    new "Mandarla a casa"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:697
    old "I can't today."
    new "Hoy no puedo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:715
    old "You take the first bus across town."
    new "Tomas el primer autobús al otro lado de la ciudad."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-03 17:52

translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:53
    old "Three soft knocks, then one hard one. You know that knock."
    new "Tres golpes suaves, y luego uno fuerte. Conoces esa forma de tocar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "She stops you in the hallway with one look, the way she must stop meetings."
    new "Te detiene en el pasillo con una sola mirada, como seguramente detiene sus reuniones."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Stand still."
    new "Quédate quieto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "She looks you over, collar to shoes, and finds everything wanting."
    new "Te examina del cuello a los zapatos, y le encuentra defectos a todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Fix your collar and thank her for noticing."
    new "Acomodarte el cuello y agradecerle que se haya fijado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "You're right. Thanks for noticing."
    new "Tienes razón. Gracias por fijarte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "...You're welcome. That's new."
    new "...De nada. Eso sí es nuevo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Don't thank me. Just look presentable."
    new "No me agradezcas. Solo procura verte presentable."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Stand straight and let her fix it."
    new "Ponerte derecho y dejar que ella lo acomode."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "She straightens your collar with two sharp tugs, like she's done it a thousand times for someone else."
    new "Te endereza el cuello con dos tirones secos, como si lo hubiera hecho mil veces para otra persona."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "There. Now you look like someone who lives here."
    new "Listo. Ahora pareces alguien que vive aquí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "I'm not your maid. Fix it yourself."
    new "No soy tu sirvienta. Arréglalo tú mismo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Ask if she inspects everyone this closely."
    new "Preguntarle si inspecciona a todos tan de cerca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Do you look at everyone this closely?"
    new "¿Miras a todo el mundo así de cerca?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Only what's under my roof. Everything under my roof gets inspected."
    new "Solo lo que está bajo mi techo. Todo lo que está bajo mi techo se inspecciona."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:457
    old "Watch the tone. This is my house."
    new "Cuida ese tono. Esta es mi casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "She steps out of a boutique with four bags and spots you before you can pretend you didn't see her."
    new "Sale de una boutique con cuatro bolsas y te ve antes de que puedas fingir que no la viste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "You. Good timing. Hold these."
    new "Tú. Justo a tiempo. Sostén esto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "She hands you the bags without waiting for an answer and starts walking."
    new "Te entrega las bolsas sin esperar respuesta y empieza a caminar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "Carry them and keep up with her."
    new "Cargar las bolsas y seguirle el paso."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "You walk beside her for three stores. She doesn't say much, but she slows her step so you can keep up."
    new "Caminas a su lado durante tres tiendas. No dice mucho, pero aminora el paso para que puedas seguirla."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "...You're more useful than you look. Lunch is on me. Eat fast."
    new "...Eres más útil de lo que pareces. El almuerzo corre por mi cuenta. Come rápido."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "Keep up or hand them back. I don't wait."
    new "Sígueme el paso o devuélvemelas. Yo no espero."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "Hold the bags out and make her take one back."
    new "Extenderle las bolsas y hacer que tome una de vuelta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "I'm not your porter. Take one."
    new "No soy tu cargador. Toma una."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "She takes one bag back. She doesn't mention it, but she watches you differently for the rest of the walk."
    new "Toma una bolsa de vuelta. No lo menciona, pero te mira de otra forma durante el resto del camino."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "You'll carry all of them now. That's how that works."
    new "Ahora vas a cargar todas. Así funciona esto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "Ask what's in the pink bag."
    new "Preguntar qué hay en la bolsa rosa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "What's in the pink one?"
    new "¿Qué hay en la rosa?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "None of your business. ...It's for a gala. Eyes forward."
    new "No es asunto tuyo. ...Es para una gala. La vista al frente."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "She almost smiled. Almost."
    new "Casi sonrió. Casi."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:481
    old "One more question like that and you'll carry these to the car. The far one."
    new "Una pregunta más como esa y cargas esto hasta el auto. El que está más lejos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "You find her in the living room with a ledger and the wine cabinet open."
    new "La encuentras en la sala con un libro de cuentas y la cava de vinos abierta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Before you ask: yes, I count them. Every week."
    new "Antes de que preguntes: sí, cuento las botellas. Cada semana."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Offer to read her the labels."
    new "Ofrecerte a leerle las etiquetas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Want a hand with the list?"
    new "¿Te doy una mano con la lista?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "...Fine. Read me the labels. Don't drop anything."
    new "...Está bien. Léeme las etiquetas. Que no se te caiga nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Ten minutes of labels and vintages. She corrects your pronunciation twice, and almost enjoys it."
    new "Diez minutos de etiquetas y cosechas. Corrige tu pronunciación dos veces, y casi lo disfruta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Touch nothing. Watch if you must."
    new "No toques nada. Puedes mirar, si tanto insistes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Tell her the bottles should lie on their sides."
    new "Decirle que las botellas deberían estar acostadas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "They should be on their sides. The corks dry out."
    new "Deberían estar acostadas. Los corchos se secan."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "...He knows about corks."
    new "...Él sabe de corchos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Fine. You rearrange, I count. Carefully."
    new "Está bien. Tú reacomodas, yo cuento. Con cuidado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "And YOU learned wine where, exactly? Hands off."
    new "¿Y dónde aprendiste TÚ de vinos, exactamente? Las manos quietas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Pour yourself a glass while she watches."
    new "Servirte una copa mientras ella mira."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "You pour two fingers and hold her stare. She lets you finish it."
    new "Te sirves dos dedos y le sostienes la mirada. Ella deja que te lo termines."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "That one was the cheap shelf, boy. But the nerve was almost expensive."
    new "Esa era del estante barato, chico. Pero el descaro fue casi de lujo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:506
    old "Put it DOWN. That bottle is worth more than your semester."
    new "Déjala EN SU LUGAR. Esa botella vale más que tu semestre."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "While you wait for the late bus, a black car with tinted windows stops in front of the building."
    new "Mientras esperas el último autobús, un auto negro con vidrios polarizados se detiene frente al edificio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "She steps out. Heels, dark coat, phone to her ear. She ends the call the moment she sees you."
    new "Baja del auto. Tacones, abrigo oscuro, el celular en la oreja. Corta la llamada en cuanto te ve."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "...You're still here."
    new "...Sigues aquí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Say the bus is late. Nothing more."
    new "Decir que el autobús viene retrasado. Nada más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Bus is late. That's all."
    new "El autobús se retrasó. Eso es todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "She holds your eyes a second longer than she needs to, then walks past you to the door."
    new "Te sostiene la mirada un segundo más de lo necesario, y luego pasa a tu lado rumbo a la puerta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Get home safe."
    new "Llega bien a casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Then wait quietly."
    new "Entonces espera en silencio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Note that it's late for a work meeting."
    new "Señalar que es tarde para una reunión de trabajo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Long meeting. At midnight."
    new "Reunión larga. A medianoche."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "The ones that matter end late."
    new "Las que importan terminan tarde."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "She says it like a closed door. But she noticed that you noticed."
    new "Lo dice como quien cierra una puerta. Pero notó que tú lo notaste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "My hours are not your concern."
    new "Mis horarios no son asunto tuyo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Ask whose car that was."
    new "Preguntar de quién era ese auto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Whose car is that?"
    new "¿De quién es ese auto?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "A driver's. Good night, [Player.Name]."
    new "De un chofer. Buenas noches, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "At the door she stops, back to you, for exactly one breath. Then she's gone."
    new "En la puerta se detiene, de espaldas a ti, el tiempo exacto de una respiración. Luego desaparece."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:531
    old "Curiosity is expensive in this family. Go home."
    new "La curiosidad sale cara en esta familia. Vete a casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Footsteps in the hallway. Slow, heavy, getting closer."
    new "Pasos en el pasillo. Lentos, pesados, cada vez más cerca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "...He's up. Don't. Move."
    new "...Se levantó. No. Te. Muevas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Freeze and hold her until they pass."
    new "Quedarte inmóvil y abrazarla hasta que los pasos se alejen."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "You hold still, her heartbeat loud against your chest, until the steps fade toward the kitchen."
    new "Te quedas inmóvil, con su corazón latiendo fuerte contra tu pecho, hasta que los pasos se pierden hacia la cocina."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "...Okay. Okay. Where were we."
    new "...Bueno. Bueno. ¿En qué estábamos?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Off. OFF. ...False alarm. God."
    new "Quítate. QUÍTATE. ...Falsa alarma. Dios."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Put your hand over her mouth and keep going slowly."
    new "Taparle la boca con la mano y seguir despacio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Her eyes go wide over your fingers. The footsteps stop, then shuffle back the way they came."
    new "Sus ojos se abren de par en par por encima de tus dedos. Los pasos se detienen, y luego regresan arrastrándose por donde vinieron."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "You are insane. ...Don't stop."
    new "Estás loco. ...No pares."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Have you lost your mind?! Not. Another. Move."
    new "¡¿Perdiste la cabeza?! Ni. Un. Movimiento. Más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "Don't even slow down."
    new "No bajar el ritmo ni un poco."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "She buries her face in the pillow. The steps pause outside the door for one endless second, then move on."
    new "Hunde la cara en la almohada. Los pasos se detienen frente a la puerta durante un segundo eterno, y luego siguen de largo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "I hate you. I hate you. Keep going."
    new "Te odio. Te odio. Sigue."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:559
    old "She goes rigid until the hallway is silent again, then glares at you like you lit the curtains on fire."
    new "Se queda rígida hasta que el pasillo vuelve a estar en silencio, y luego te fulmina con la mirada como si le hubieras prendido fuego a las cortinas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "She closes the ledger she wasn't reading and looks at you for a long moment."
    new "Cierra el libro de cuentas que no estaba leyendo y te mira durante un largo momento."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "Sit down, [Player.Name]. Hands on your knees."
    new "Siéntate, [Player.Name]. Las manos en las rodillas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "Tonight happens the way I say it happens. Nod if you understand."
    new "Esta noche las cosas pasan como yo diga. Asiente si entiendes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "Come here. I've been thinking about this all day, and I HATE thinking about you all day."
    new "Ven aquí. Llevo todo el día pensando en esto, y ODIO pasarme el día entero pensando en ti."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "You get to watch. That's all. One wrong move and this never happens again."
    new "Tú solo vas a mirar. Nada más. Un movimiento en falso y esto no vuelve a pasar nunca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "...Fine. Tell me what you want tonight. Within reason, boy."
    new "...Está bien. Dime qué quieres esta noche. Dentro de lo razonable, chico."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "You keep your phone in your pocket and your mouth shut. Those are the terms. Sit."
    new "Mantienes el teléfono en el bolsillo y la boca cerrada. Esas son las condiciones. Siéntate."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "Afterwards she fixes her hair in the hallway mirror like nothing happened."
    new "Después, se arregla el pelo en el espejo del pasillo como si nada hubiera pasado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:584
    old "Not a word about this. To anyone. ...Goodnight, [Player.Name]."
    new "Ni una palabra de esto. A nadie. ...Buenas noches, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:608
    old "She catches your wrist in the hallway. In the living room, the game is loud and your father is louder."
    new "Te agarra de la muñeca en el pasillo. En la sala, el partido suena fuerte y tu padre, todavía más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:608
    old "Four minutes. He never leaves the couch before the second half."
    new "Cuatro minutos. Nunca se levanta del sofá antes del segundo tiempo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:608
    old "She pulls you into the kitchen, out of the doorway's line of sight."
    new "Te mete en la cocina, donde no se ve desde la puerta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:608
    old "Quiet. If you make a sound, I will end you."
    new "Silencio. Si haces un solo ruido, acabo contigo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:608
    old "She's back at the counter rinsing a glass before the commercial break ends."
    new "Ya está de vuelta frente al fregadero, enjuagando un vaso, antes de que termine el corte comercial."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:608
    old "Four minutes. I told you. ...Wipe that look off your face before you walk out there."
    new "Cuatro minutos. Te lo dije. ...Borra esa expresión de tu cara antes de volver allá."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "She walks in past you without a word, already pulling off her coat."
    new "Entra pasando a tu lado sin decir una palabra, ya quitándose el abrigo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "Don't talk. Tonight I'm not here to talk."
    new "No hables. Esta noche no vine a hablar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "I missed you. Say it back or don't, I'll have you either way."
    new "Te extrañé. Dilo tú también o no lo digas, de todas formas te voy a tener."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "Your father thinks I'm at a work dinner. Dessert is in your bed, apparently."
    new "Tu padre cree que estoy en una cena de trabajo. El postre se sirve en tu cama, al parecer."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "Tell me how you want me. You've earned the right to answer that."
    new "Dime cómo me quieres. Te ganaste el derecho a responder eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "No condom, no sex. My rules haven't changed. ...Sit down, I'll handle you another way."
    new "Sin condón, no hay sexo. Mis reglas no han cambiado. ...Siéntate, me encargo de ti de otra forma."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "She dresses with the efficiency of someone catching a flight."
    new "Se viste con la eficiencia de alguien que tiene que tomar un vuelo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:622
    old "I was never here. ...Same time next week, maybe. If you behave."
    new "Nunca estuve aquí. ...A la misma hora la semana que viene, quizás. Si te portas bien."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Your last exam is on my desk."
    new "Tu último examen está en mi escritorio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Explain to me why I shouldn't show your father."
    new "Explícame por qué no debería mostrárselo a tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "I'll do better. I mean that."
    new "Voy a mejorar. Lo digo en serio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Words. I collect better ones from lawyers every week."
    new "Palabras. Cada semana colecciono mejores, de boca de abogados."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "...But fine. Prove it."
    new "...Pero está bien. Demuéstralo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "I've heard that one before. From better students."
    new "Ya he oído eso antes. De mejores estudiantes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "I'm already studying. You'll see it on the next exam."
    new "Ya estoy estudiando. Lo vas a ver en el próximo examen."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Good. I won't remind you again."
    new "Bien. No te lo voy a recordar otra vez."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "The next exam, then. I keep receipts."
    new "El próximo examen, entonces. Guardo los comprobantes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Don't promise me schedules. Deliver."
    new "No me prometas plazos. Entrega resultados."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Then show him. I'm not afraid of you."
    new "Entonces muéstraselo. No te tengo miedo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "...Bold. Stupid, but bold."
    new "...Atrevido. Estúpido, pero atrevido."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Keep that nerve. You'll need it in my house."
    new "Conserva esas agallas. Las vas a necesitar en mi casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Careful, boy. You have no idea who you're baiting."
    new "Cuidado, chico. No tienes idea de a quién estás provocando."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Who are you with right now?"
    new "¿Con quién estás ahora mismo?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Nobody. Thinking about you, actually."
    new "Con nadie. Pensando en ti, la verdad."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "...I hate how much I liked it."
    new "...Odio lo mucho que me gustó."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Because what's mine, I keep track of."
    new "Porque lo que es mío, lo vigilo de cerca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Don't make me ask twice."
    new "No me hagas preguntar dos veces."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Forget I asked."
    new "Olvida que pregunté."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Jealous?"
    new "¿Celosa?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Terribly. Now answer the question."
    new "Terriblemente. Ahora responde la pregunta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Don't flatter yourself."
    new "No te hagas ilusiones."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "One of your shirts is missing."
    new "Falta una de tus camisas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Keep it. It looks better on you."
    new "Quédatela. Se te ve mejor a ti."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Of course I'm keeping it. It wasn't a question."
    new "Claro que me la quedo. No era una pregunta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Bring it back tomorrow. Worn."
    new "Devuélvemela mañana. Usada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "It's MY shirt now. Learn to count your laundry."
    new "Ahora la camisa es MÍA. Aprende a contar tu ropa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "Just the shirt? Send proof."
    new "¿Solo la camisa? Manda una prueba."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:734
    old "You wish. Goodnight, boy."
    new "Ya quisieras. Buenas noches, chico."

