translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Another dinner, another wall. She treats you like a guest who stayed too long. Maybe if she liked you a little more, next Sunday would go differently."
    new "Otra cena, otro muro. Te trata como a un invitado que se quedó demasiado. Quizás si le cayeras un poco mejor, el próximo domingo sería distinto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "For a second tonight, she almost smiled at you. Almost. She's warming up to you... a little more, and the next dinner might not end like this one."
    new "Por un segundo esta noche, casi te sonrió. Casi. Se está abriendo contigo... un poco más, y la próxima cena podría no terminar como esta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She sat through the whole dinner like a signed contract, every word measured. Maybe if she let her guard down around you, things would change."
    new "Pasó toda la cena como un contrato firmado, cada palabra medida. Quizás si bajara la guardia contigo, las cosas cambiarían."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She laughed at something tonight, and her eyes found yours while she did. She's loosening up around you. A little more..."
    new "Esta noche se rió de algo, y sus ojos buscaron los tuyos mientras lo hacía. Se está soltando contigo. Un poco más..."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She ran the table like a board meeting, and you were the intern. Maybe if she took you seriously, she'd stop treating you like a boy."
    new "Manejó la mesa como una junta directiva, y tú eras el pasante. Quizás si te tomara en serio, dejaría de tratarte como a un chico."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Tonight she actually waited for you to finish talking. She's starting to take you seriously. Push a little more."
    new "Esta noche de verdad esperó a que terminaras de hablar. Empieza a tomarte en serio. Insiste un poco más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Her phone buzzed twice during dinner, and twice she stepped out to answer it. Whatever she does after she sends you home at night... knowing it might change how she looks at you."
    new "Su teléfono vibró dos veces durante la cena, y las dos veces salió a contestar. Lo que sea que haga después de mandarte a casa por la noche... saberlo podría cambiar cómo te mira."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Lying in the dark, you think about her. She lets you close now, but only when she decides. Maybe if she cared more, one night she'd come to you."
    new "Acostado en la oscuridad, piensas en ella. Ahora te deja acercarte, pero solo cuando ella lo decide. Quizás si le importaras más, una noche vendría a ti."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "You catch yourself listening for a knock that never comes. She's closer than she's ever been. A little more, and one night she might knock."
    new "Te descubres esperando un golpe en la puerta que nunca llega. Está más cerca que nunca. Un poco más, y una noche podría tocar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She plays with you, but she never lets you see her lose control. Maybe if she dared a little more, she wouldn't spend tonight at home."
    new "Juega contigo, pero nunca te deja verla perder el control. Quizás si se atreviera un poco más, no pasaría esta noche en casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Lately she's been bolder, and she knows it. A little more nerve, and she'll stop pretending this is only a game."
    new "Últimamente está más atrevida, y lo sabe. Un poco más de valor, y dejará de fingir que esto es solo un juego."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She still decides everything between you two. Maybe if she listened to you more, she'd come to you instead of making you wait."
    new "Ella todavía decide todo entre ustedes dos. Quizás si te hiciera más caso, vendría a ti en vez de hacerte esperar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She's started doing what you tell her, and it surprises her more than it surprises you. A little more, and she'll come when you want her."
    new "Empezó a hacer lo que le dices, y eso la sorprende más a ella que a ti. Un poco más, y vendrá cuando tú quieras."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "You scroll through your phone before you sleep. What you have on her isn't enough to make her come to you. Not yet."
    new "Revisas tu teléfono antes de dormir. Lo que tienes sobre ella no basta para que venga a ti. Todavía no."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "What you have on her is starting to weigh on her. A little more, and she won't be able to keep you at arm's length."
    new "Lo que tienes sobre ella empieza a pesarle. Un poco más, y no podrá mantenerte a distancia."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father is away, and that apartment is all hers today. Your phone stays quiet. Maybe if she loved you enough to risk it..."
    new "Tu padre está de viaje, y ese departamento es todo suyo hoy. Tu teléfono sigue en silencio. Quizás si te quisiera lo suficiente para arriesgarse..."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father is away, and part of you expected her to text. She didn't. Not today. But she's close to letting you all the way in."
    new "Tu padre está de viaje, y una parte de ti esperaba un mensaje suyo. No llegó. Hoy no. Pero está cerca de dejarte entrar del todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father is out of town, and she doesn't call. There's still one place she won't take you: the bed she shares with him. Maybe if she were bolder..."
    new "Tu padre está fuera de la ciudad, y ella no llama. Todavía hay un lugar al que no te lleva: la cama que comparte con él. Quizás si fuera más atrevida..."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father is away. She didn't call, but you can feel it: one more push and she'll stop caring whose bed it is."
    new "Tu padre está de viaje. No llamó, pero lo sientes: un empujón más y dejará de importarle de quién es esa cama."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father is out of town, and she's alone in that apartment. She doesn't call you over. She still answers to herself before she answers to you."
    new "Tu padre está fuera de la ciudad, y ella está sola en ese departamento. No te llama. Todavía responde ante sí misma antes que ante ti."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father is away. She didn't call, but she obeys you more every day. Soon she'll come when you call her... wherever you want."
    new "Tu padre está de viaje. No llamó, pero te obedece más cada día. Pronto vendrá cuando la llames... adonde tú quieras."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Another Sunday dinner. She's yours now, but there's still a wall between you. Something strong enough to knock it down... and knock him out. If she loved you enough."
    new "Otra cena de domingo. Ahora es tuya, pero todavía hay un muro entre ustedes. Algo lo bastante fuerte para derribarlo... y dejarlo a él fuera de combate. Si te quisiera lo suficiente."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She looks at you across the table like she's waiting for you to do something bold. A strong drink in his glass might be all it takes."
    new "Te mira desde el otro lado de la mesa como si esperara que hicieras algo atrevido. Un trago fuerte en su vaso podría ser todo lo que hace falta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "Your father drinks his wine, and she watches you over the rim of her glass. She's daring you to push further. Maybe a stronger drink would tip the scales."
    new "Tu padre bebe su vino, y ella te observa por encima del borde de su copa. Te está retando a ir más lejos. Quizás un trago más fuerte inclinaría la balanza."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She's ready. You can see it in the way she watches him drink. One strong pour, and the last wall between you comes down."
    new "Está lista. Se nota en cómo lo mira beber. Un trago fuerte, y el último muro entre ustedes se derrumba."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She's yours behind closed doors, but the doors are still closed. Your father sits at the head of the table, oblivious. A strong drink might fix that."
    new "Es tuya a puertas cerradas, pero las puertas siguen cerradas. Tu padre se sienta a la cabecera de la mesa, ajeno a todo. Un trago fuerte podría arreglar eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:152
    old "She obeys you now. All that's left is getting him out of the way. A strong drink in his glass, and the night is yours."
    new "Ahora te obedece. Solo falta quitarlo a él del camino. Un trago fuerte en su vaso, y la noche es tuya."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:222
    old "Raise your stats with her and bring a strong drink to the Sunday dinner."
    new "Sube tus estadísticas con ella y lleva un trago fuerte a la cena del domingo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "You know what I could go for? A real whiskey. The kind that burns going down."
    new "¿Sabes qué se me antoja? Un whisky de verdad. De esos que queman al bajar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "He swirls his wine and stares at it like it insulted him."
    new "Agita el vino en la copa y lo mira como si lo hubiera insultado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "This is fine, but it's not the same. Nothing beats a good, strong drink."
    new "Este está bien, pero no es lo mismo. Nada le gana a un buen trago fuerte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Tell him you'll get one for next time."
    new "Decirle que le conseguirás una para la próxima."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "I'll bring you something strong next time. Promise."
    new "La próxima vez te traigo algo fuerte. Lo prometo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Ha! I like that. See, honey? The kid gets it."
    new "¡Ja! Eso me gusta. ¿Ves, cariño? El chico lo entiende."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "I'll believe it when I see it."
    new "Lo creeré cuando lo vea."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Say he deserves the good stuff."
    new "Decir que él se merece lo bueno."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "A man like you deserves better than wine."
    new "Un hombre como tú se merece algo mejor que vino."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Damn right! See? This one has taste."
    new "¡Claro que sí! ¿Ves? Este sí tiene buen gusto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Don't butter me up, son."
    new "No me adules, hijo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Glance at her while he talks about drinks."
    new "Mirarla mientras él habla de tragos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "She catches your look and holds it. Something in her eyes tells you she's thinking the same thing you are."
    new "Ella capta tu mirada y la sostiene. Algo en sus ojos te dice que está pensando lo mismo que tú."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "She doesn't notice. She's busy refilling her own glass."
    new "No se da cuenta. Está ocupada sirviéndose otra copa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "She brushes her lips past your ear as she clears the plates."
    new "Te roza la oreja con los labios mientras levanta los platos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Bring something strong next time. For him."
    new "Trae algo fuerte la próxima vez. Para él."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Dessert is familiar. She eats slowly, watching the two of you with a look you can't quite read."
    new "El postre es el de siempre. Ella come despacio, observándolos a los dos con una mirada que no logras descifrar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:303
    old "Of course. We wouldn't miss it."
    new "Claro. No nos lo perderíamos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1381
    old "I set the pace here. Not you."
    new "Aquí el ritmo lo marco yo. No tú."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1386
    old "Don't even think about moving. This is my show."
    new "Ni se te ocurra moverte. Este es mi show."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1390
    old "You want more? Too bad."
    new "¿Quieres más? Qué lástima."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1394
    old "She grinds against you in slow, deliberate circles."
    new "Se frota contra ti en círculos lentos y deliberados."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1399
    old "Every time you try to push deeper, she pulls away."
    new "Cada vez que intentas ir más hondo, ella se aparta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1403
    old "You feel yourself getting dangerously close."
    new "Sientes que estás peligrosamente cerca."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1415
    old "You don't get to finish until I say so."
    new "No vas a acabar hasta que yo lo diga."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1431
    old "She starts lowering herself... slowly."
    new "Empieza a bajar... despacio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1468
    old "She slowly lifts herself off you."
    new "Se levanta de encima de ti, despacio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1510
    old "Sunday dinner. Your father pours the wine, talks about work, and laughs at his own jokes. He's in a good mood tonight."
    new "Cena de domingo. Tu padre sirve el vino, habla del trabajo y se ríe de sus propios chistes. Esta noche está de buen humor."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1510
    old "You know what would make this night perfect? A proper drink. Not this wine stuff."
    new "¿Sabes qué haría perfecta esta noche? Un trago de verdad. No esta cosa de vino."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1510
    old "Something with kick. Something that burns."
    new "Algo con fuerza. Algo que queme."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1510
    old "He looks at you like he just gave you a mission."
    new "Te mira como si acabara de darte una misión."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1528
    old "No? Ah well. Maybe next time."
    new "¿No? Bueno, qué se le va a hacer. Quizás la próxima."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1544
    old "Oh, nice! Thanks, son."
    new "¡Oh, qué bien! Gracias, hijo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1544
    old "He takes a long sip and nods appreciatively."
    new "Da un trago largo y asiente con aprobación."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1544
    old "Good stuff. Not strong enough to knock me out, though!"
    new "Está bueno. ¡Pero no tan fuerte como para tumbarme!"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1544
    old "He laughs and pats his chest. The dinner continues normally."
    new "Se ríe y se da palmaditas en el pecho. La cena sigue con normalidad."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1554
    old "Now THAT'S what I'm talking about!"
    new "¡ESO es de lo que hablo!"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1554
    old "He pours himself a generous glass and drinks it like water."
    new "Se sirve un vaso generoso y se lo toma como si fuera agua."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1554
    old "Whew! That's the real stuff right there."
    new "¡Uf! Esto sí es de lo bueno."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1562
    old "He pours another. Then another. His voice gets louder, his words slower."
    new "Se sirve otro. Y otro más. Su voz se vuelve más fuerte, sus palabras más lentas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1562
    old "You know... you're a good kid. Best thing I ever did was... bring you here..."
    new "¿Sabes...? Eres un buen chico. Lo mejor que hice en mi vida fue... traerte aquí..."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1562
    old "His head sinks. His glass tilts. She catches it before it spills."
    new "Su cabeza cae. Su vaso se inclina. Ella lo atrapa antes de que se derrame."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1562
    old "He's out cold."
    new "Quedó fuera de combate."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1581
    old "She watches him for a long moment, then looks at you."
    new "Lo observa un largo momento, y luego te mira."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1586
    old "Did you plan this?"
    new "¿Planeaste esto?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1586
    old "She doesn't wait for an answer."
    new "No espera respuesta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1586
    old "...Come with me."
    new "...Ven conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1592
    old "Well played."
    new "Bien jugado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1592
    old "Bedroom. Now."
    new "Al cuarto. Ya."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1597
    old "You did this on purpose."
    new "Lo hiciste a propósito."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1597
    old "She takes your hand and pulls you to the bedroom."
    new "Te toma de la mano y te lleva al cuarto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1622
    old "No condom. Not tonight."
    new "Sin condón. Esta noche no."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1653
    old "I've been wanting this. Wanting you. All of you."
    new "Llevaba tiempo deseando esto. Deseándote. Entero."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1653
    old "No more rules. No more holding back."
    new "Se acabaron las reglas. Se acabó contenerme."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1658
    old "I didn't think I'd ever say this to you."
    new "Nunca pensé que te diría esto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1658
    old "You're in charge now. Completely."
    new "Ahora mandas tú. Por completo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1663
    old "You took what you wanted. Just like I knew you would."
    new "Tomaste lo que querías. Justo como sabía que lo harías."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1663
    old "Don't stop now."
    new "No te detengas ahora."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-11 20:54

translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:55
    old "Everything, her way."
    new "Todo, a su manera."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:55
    old "Only her mouth tonight."
    new "Solo su boca esta noche."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:55
    old "Her way. Nothing between you."
    new "A su manera. Nada entre ustedes."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:55
    old "With a condom."
    new "Con condón."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:174
    old "Your father is away, and she knows exactly what's on your phone. It isn't heavy enough yet to pull her across that line. More material would change the math."
    new "Tu padre está de viaje, y ella sabe exactamente lo que hay en tu celular. Todavía no pesa lo suficiente para hacerla cruzar esa línea. Con más material, las cuentas serían otras."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:174
    old "Your father is away. What you hold on her is almost enough to make her open that bedroom herself. One more piece."
    new "Tu padre está de viaje. Lo que tienes sobre ella casi alcanza para que ella misma te abra la puerta de ese dormitorio. Falta una pieza más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:174
    old "She watches your pocket more than your plate these days. What you have on her won't carry the last step yet. More footage... and your father would need to be very, very asleep."
    new "Últimamente mira tu bolsillo más que tu plato. Lo que tienes sobre ella todavía no alcanza para el último paso. Más grabaciones... y tu padre tendría que estar muy, muy dormido."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:174
    old "What you hold on her could end her world, and she knows it. One strong drink in his glass tonight, and she won't say no to anything."
    new "Lo que tienes sobre ella podría acabar con su mundo, y ella lo sabe. Un trago fuerte en su vaso esta noche, y no le dirá que no a nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "Find out where she goes at night after she sends you away."
    new "Descubre adónde va de noche después de despacharte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "Everything is in place. Sit through the next Sunday dinner."
    new "Todo está en su lugar. Quédate hasta el final de la próxima cena del domingo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "Get at least a B on an exam, then sleep alone in your room. What you hold over her opens her door."
    new "Saca al menos un B en un examen, luego duerme solo en tu cuarto. Lo que tienes sobre ella abre su puerta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "She is ready. Get at least a B on an exam if you haven't, then sleep alone in your room while her husband is home."
    new "Está lista. Saca al menos un B en un examen si aún no lo hiciste, y luego duerme solo en tu cuarto mientras su esposo esté en casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "Wait for a morning when her husband is away. What you hold on her will do the asking."
    new "Espera una mañana en que su esposo esté de viaje. Lo que tienes sobre ella pedirá por ti."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "She is ready. Wait for a morning when her husband leaves on a trip, and answer her text."
    new "Está lista. Espera una mañana en que su esposo salga de viaje, y responde su mensaje."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "Bring a strong drink to the Sunday dinner. The bar video alone won't carry this: you need real footage of her too."
    new "Lleva un trago fuerte a la cena del domingo. El video del bar no alcanza por sí solo: también necesitas una grabación real de ella."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:256
    old "Tonight could be the night. Bring a strong drink to the Sunday dinner."
    new "Esta podría ser la noche. Lleva un trago fuerte a la cena del domingo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "She studies you for a long moment, the way she studies an audit she did not order."
    new "Te estudia durante un largo momento, como estudia una auditoría que ella no pidió."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "So that's how you want to play it. Fine. We both know what you saw."
    new "Entonces así quieres jugar. Bien. Los dos sabemos lo que viste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "Nothing here changes out of affection, [Player.Name]. It changes because you hold a camera and I hold a life worth keeping."
    new "Aquí nada cambia por afecto, [Player.Name]. Cambia porque tú tienes una cámara y yo tengo una vida que vale la pena conservar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "Don't mistake this for winning, [Player.Name]. You didn't win me. You cornered me."
    new "No confundas esto con ganar, [Player.Name]. No me conquistaste. Me acorralaste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "In front of your father, nothing changes. I'm still his wife. And you are still the boy holding a phone over my life."
    new "Frente a tu padre, nada cambia. Sigo siendo su esposa. Y tú sigues siendo el chico que tiene mi vida colgando de un celular."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "Behind his back, take what you're taking. ...And one day, when that video is worth nothing, you and I will have a very different conversation."
    new "A sus espaldas, toma lo que estás tomando. ...Y algún día, cuando ese video ya no valga nada, tú y yo vamos a tener una conversación muy distinta."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "This is not affection. This is arithmetic. Remember that."
    new "Esto no es afecto. Es aritmética. Recuérdalo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:282
    old "You didn't win me. You cornered me. There is a difference, and one day you will learn it."
    new "No me conquistaste. Me acorralaste. Hay una diferencia, y algún día la vas a aprender."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:530
    old "She stops at the foot of the bed and finally looks at you. Not at your eyes. At the pocket where you keep your phone."
    new "Se detiene al pie de la cama y por fin te mira. No a los ojos. Al bolsillo donde guardas el celular."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:530
    old "So this is what it costs. Fine. But listen carefully: you get what I give you, the way I give it."
    new "Así que este es el precio. Bien. Pero escucha con atención: recibes lo que yo te dé, como yo te lo dé."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:530
    old "And when you're done congratulating yourself, remember who chose the room."
    new "Y cuando termines de felicitarte, recuerda quién eligió el cuarto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "You run into her at the mall, two bags already hanging from her arm. She hands them to you without asking."
    new "Te topas con ella en el centro comercial, con dos bolsas ya colgando del brazo. Te las pasa sin preguntar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Good timing. Walk with me."
    new "Justo a tiempo. Acompáñame."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "At the counter she pays for her things, then nods at the espresso bar and orders two cups without asking you either."
    new "En la caja paga sus cosas, luego señala con la cabeza la barra de espresso y pide dos tazas, sin preguntarte a ti tampoco."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Sit. You have ten minutes of my afternoon."
    new "Siéntate. Tienes diez minutos de mi tarde."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Ask how her week actually went."
    new "Preguntarle cómo le fue de verdad en la semana."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "...Long. Expensive. Full of men who talk too much."
    new "...Larga. Cara. Llena de hombres que hablan demasiado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "She stirs her coffee, and for one second the boardroom face slips."
    new "Revuelve su café, y por un segundo se le cae la máscara de ejecutiva."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Thank you for asking. Nobody does."
    new "Gracias por preguntar. Nadie lo hace."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "We are not there yet. Drink your coffee."
    new "Todavía no llegamos a eso. Tómate tu café."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Wait quietly until she puts the phone down."
    new "Esperar en silencio hasta que deje el celular."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Look at that. A boy who knows how to wait."
    new "Mira nada más. Un chico que sabe esperar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "She puts the phone away sooner than she meant to."
    new "Guarda el celular antes de lo que pensaba."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Patience looks forced on you. Work on it."
    new "En ti, la paciencia se ve forzada. Trabaja en eso."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Tease her about spoiling you."
    new "Provocarla diciendo que te consiente."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Careful. People will think you're spoiling me."
    new "Cuidado. La gente va a pensar que me estás consintiendo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Let them think. They would be wrong, and you would be carrying bags either way."
    new "Que piensen. Estarían equivocados, y tú cargarías bolsas de todas formas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "They would think you talk too much. Carry the bags."
    new "Pensarían que hablas demasiado. Carga las bolsas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Ten minutes later she stands, takes her bags back, and leaves you with the bill for the coffees."
    new "Diez minutos después, se levanta, recupera sus bolsas y te deja la cuenta de los cafés."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:598
    old "Same time next week, maybe. If you behave."
    new "Misma hora la próxima semana, tal vez. Si te portas bien."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "A black car idles at the campus curb with the engine running. The rear window rolls down two fingers."
    new "Un auto negro espera junto a la acera del campus con el motor encendido. La ventanilla trasera baja dos dedos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Get in. Ten minutes."
    new "Sube. Diez minutos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Inside it smells like leather and her perfume. The driver is nowhere to be seen."
    new "Adentro huele a cuero y a su perfume. No hay rastro del chofer."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Phone on silent. Those are the rules of this car."
    new "Celular en silencio. Esas son las reglas de este auto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Ask her what's wrong."
    new "Preguntarle qué le pasa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Nothing is wrong. I had ten free minutes and I chose this. Don't make it bigger than it is."
    new "No me pasa nada. Tenía diez minutos libres y elegí esto. No lo hagas más grande de lo que es."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Her hand finds yours anyway, and stays."
    new "Aun así, su mano encuentra la tuya, y se queda ahí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "If something were wrong, you would never hear it from me in a parking lot."
    new "Si me pasara algo, jamás lo oirías de mí en un estacionamiento."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Sit still and let her decide the ten minutes."
    new "Quedarse quieto y dejar que ella decida los diez minutos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "She takes her time. When she finally leans over, it costs the whole ten minutes and change."
    new "Se toma su tiempo. Cuando por fin se inclina sobre ti, le cuesta los diez minutos completos y un poco más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Good boy. Out you go."
    new "Buen chico. Ahora bájate."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "You fidget like a freshman. Out. We'll try again when you can sit still."
    new "No paras de moverte, como un novato. Bájate. Lo intentaremos otra vez cuando puedas quedarte quieto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Remark on what the tinted windows are for."
    new "Comentar para qué sirven los vidrios polarizados."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "So this is what the quiet windows are for."
    new "Así que para esto sirven estos vidrios tan discretos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "These windows have seen board members cry. They can keep one more secret."
    new "Estos vidrios han visto llorar a miembros de la junta. Pueden guardar un secreto más."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "The ten minutes do not involve much talking after that."
    new "Después de eso, en esos diez minutos no se habla mucho."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "This car is for ten quiet minutes. You just spent two of them on a joke."
    new "Este auto es para diez minutos de silencio. Acabas de gastar dos en un chiste."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "At minute ten exactly, the lock clicks open. Whatever happened in there stays in the leather."
    new "Justo al minuto diez, el seguro se abre con un clic. Lo que haya pasado ahí dentro se queda en el cuero de los asientos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:630
    old "Walk away first. I'll wait."
    new "Vete tú primero. Yo espero."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:988
    old "This never happened. ...Until next time."
    new "Esto nunca pasó. ...Hasta la próxima vez."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "...I'm deleting this conversation."
    new "...Voy a borrar esta conversación."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "That wasn't a no. Goodnight."
    new "Eso no fue un no. Buenas noches."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "You know exactly what. I'm not typing it."
    new "Sabes perfectamente qué. No lo voy a escribir."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "It isn't lost. That's all you need to know."
    new "No está perdida. Es todo lo que necesitas saber."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "It's being put to good use. Goodnight."
    new "Le estoy dando un buen uso. Buenas noches."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "...You've gotten bold. Tomorrow. And I'm deleting this chat."
    new "...Te volviste atrevido. Mañana. Y voy a borrar este chat."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "Nothing leaves this phone. Ever. You get the real thing or you get nothing."
    new "Nada sale de este celular. Nunca. O lo ves en persona, o no ves nada."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "Thank you. You're not getting it back."
    new "Gracias. No la vas a recuperar."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "It's on my side of the bed. That's all I'll write."
    new "Está en mi lado de la cama. Es todo lo que voy a escribir."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "Understood. ...And then I'm deleting this chat."
    new "Entendido. ...Y luego voy a borrar este chat."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1014
    old "...I can't. You know I can't. Ask me for anything else and it's yes."
    new "...No puedo. Sabes que no puedo. Pídeme cualquier otra cosa y es un sí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1256
    old "Leave her hand where it is."
    new "Dejar su mano donde está."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1260
    old "Move her hand higher yourself."
    new "Subir tú mismo su mano."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1261
    old "You put your hand over hers and slide it higher up your leg. For half a second, her fingers forget what they were doing."
    new "Pones tu mano sobre la suya y la deslizas más arriba por tu pierna. Durante medio segundo, sus dedos olvidan lo que estaban haciendo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1265
    old "Noted, [Player.Name]. Interesting."
    new "Anotado, [Player.Name]. Interesante."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1269
    old "Move her hand away, gently."
    new "Apartar su mano, con suavidad."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1270
    old "You put your hand over hers and move it back, gently, to her own side of the table. She lets you."
    new "Pones tu mano sobre la suya y la regresas, con suavidad, a su lado de la mesa. Ella se deja."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1273
    old "Pass the salad, [Player.Name]."
    new "Pásame la ensalada, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1494
    old "One rule. You warn me before you finish. Say nothing else, just warn me."
    new "Una regla. Me avisas antes de acabar. No digas nada más, solo avísame."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1509
    old "That's all you're taking tonight? ...Noted."
    new "¿Eso es todo lo que te vas a llevar esta noche? ...Anotado."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1631
    old "I don't beg. Move your hips."
    new "Yo no ruego. Mueve esas caderas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1638
    old "Her rhythm stops. For a moment, the only sound in the room is her breathing."
    new "Su ritmo se detiene. Por un momento, el único sonido en la habitación es su respiración."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1640
    old "...Look at you. Giving orders in my bed."
    new "...Mírate. Dando órdenes en mi cama."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1641
    old "One time, I'll allow it."
    new "Por una vez, lo permito."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1646
    old "Orders? From you? That's adorable."
    new "¿Órdenes? ¿De ti? Qué adorable."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1649
    old "She lifts herself until you almost slip out, and holds there."
    new "Se levanta hasta que casi te sales de ella, y se queda ahí."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1650
    old "We start over. And this time, you'll ask nicely."
    new "Empezamos de nuevo. Y esta vez, me lo vas a pedir como se debe."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1654
    old "Lift her off and end this."
    new "Quitártela de encima y terminar con esto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1658
    old "You take her by the hips, lift her off you, and sit up."
    new "La tomas de las caderas, te la quitas de encima y te incorporas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1661
    old "I'm not spending the night being rationed. We're done here."
    new "No voy a pasarme la noche a pan y agua. Aquí terminamos."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1663
    old "Then we are done. Get out of my bedroom."
    new "Entonces terminamos. Sal de mi habitación."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1752
    old "...And that stamina. I lost count. Do not let it go to your head."
    new "...Y esa resistencia. Perdí la cuenta. Que no se te suba a la cabeza."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1755
    old "Impressive stamina. Entirely wasted: you finished over and over, and I finished nothing."
    new "Resistencia impresionante. Totalmente desperdiciada: acabaste una y otra vez, y yo ni una sola."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1756
    old "Next time, slower. A woman is not a finish line. ...Goodnight, [Player.Name]."
    new "La próxima vez, más despacio. Una mujer no es una línea de meta. ...Buenas noches, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1861
    old "...You planned this. Of course you did. You collect leverage the way other boys collect excuses."
    new "...Planeaste esto. Claro que sí. Coleccionas ases bajo la manga como otros chicos coleccionan excusas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1861
    old "Fine. Tonight you get everything. Not for what's on your phone. Because I decided I feel like it."
    new "Está bien. Esta noche te llevas todo. No por lo que tienes en el celular. Porque decidí que se me antoja."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1877
    old "Follow her."
    new "Seguirla."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1884
    old "Not like this. Walk away."
    new "Así no. Irte."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1885
    old "...Not like this."
    new "...Así no."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1886
    old "You put your own father to sleep at my table, and NOW you find a conscience?"
    new "Dormiste a tu propio padre en mi mesa, ¿y AHORA te sale la conciencia?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1886
    old "Help me carry him to the couch. Then get out of my home."
    new "Ayúdame a llevarlo al sofá. Después vete de mi casa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1929
    old "A condom. ...So you do have limits after all. Fine. Tonight, your rules."
    new "Un condón. ...Así que sí tienes límites, después de todo. Está bien. Esta noche, tus reglas."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1974
    old "Go on then. Take your prize. We both know you'll delete nothing, and I'll pretend I don't care."
    new "Adelante, entonces. Toma tu premio. Los dos sabemos que no vas a borrar nada, y yo voy a fingir que no me importa."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1974
    old "Lucky for you... tonight I really don't."
    new "Suerte la tuya... esta noche de verdad no me importa."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-12 11:04

translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:738
    old "Wrinkled shirt. Yesterday's hair. You go out in public looking like that?"
    new "Camisa arrugada. Peinado de ayer. ¿Así sales a la calle?"

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "Nobody stopped her downstairs. The night porter waved her through without a word. Her name sits near the top of the campus donor wall, and he knows it."
    new "Nadie la detuvo abajo. El portero de noche la dejó pasar sin decir palabra. Su nombre está casi en lo más alto del muro de donantes del campus, y él lo sabe."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "We haven't made arrangements for your silence yet. Your grades say you have a brain. Prove it. Listen closely, boy."
    new "Todavía no hemos arreglado los términos de tu silencio. Tus notas dicen que tienes cerebro. Demuéstralo. Escucha con atención, chico."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "You keep your little video. Keep it safe. We both know it never really goes away. As long as it stays between us, you've shown me you're worth something."
    new "Quédate con tu videíto. Guárdalo bien. Los dos sabemos que nunca desaparece de verdad. Mientras se quede entre nosotros, me habrás demostrado que vales algo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "If your father ever sees it, I'll have your balls on my desk within the hour. Nobody would find the rest of you. I won't repeat that."
    new "Si tu padre llega a verlo, tendré tus huevos sobre mi escritorio en menos de una hora. Nadie encontraría el resto de ti. No lo voy a repetir."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "I'm not a monster. We can even make a game of it. You pretend you have something on me, and I play the scared little victim who'd do anything to keep her secret."
    new "No soy un monstruo. Hasta podemos hacerlo un juego. Tú finges que tienes algo contra mí, y yo hago de la pobre víctima asustada que haría cualquier cosa por guardar su secreto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "Just remember it's a game, boy. You get exactly what I choose to give you. Tonight, I choose this."
    new "Solo recuerda que es un juego, chico. Recibes exactamente lo que yo decido darte. Esta noche, decido esto."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:941
    old "She's already unbuttoning her coat."
    new "Ya se está desabotonando el abrigo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:995
    old "Heh. I enjoyed that more than I should have. Maybe I'll use you as my little toy now and then. Don't get excited, boy. I still call the shots here."
    new "Je. Lo disfruté más de lo que debería. Tal vez te use como mi juguetito de vez en cuando. No te emociones, chico. Aquí sigo mandando yo."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:995
    old "She buttons her coat and leaves without looking back."
    new "Se abotona el abrigo y se va sin mirar atrás."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1026
    old "The two of you keep texting for a while. She finds a way to come out on top of every single exchange."
    new "Ustedes dos siguen escribiéndose un rato. Ella encuentra la forma de salir ganando en cada intercambio."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1026
    old "The conversation drifts on longer than either of you would admit. Somehow she always gets the last word."
    new "La conversación se alarga más de lo que cualquiera de los dos admitiría. De algún modo, ella siempre tiene la última palabra."

    # game/scripts/Events/stepmom_story.rpy:1026
    old "You trade messages until your eyes get heavy. Win or lose, she types like she has already won."
    new "Se mandan mensajes hasta que te pesan los ojos. Gane o pierda, escribe como si ya hubiera ganado."

